@startuml
title 0006-web-ui - operator surface without auth

actor "Operator" as Operator
participant "Web UI" as UI
participant "API Gateway\nno-auth mode" as GW
participant "State Registry" as State
participant "Env Registry" as Env
participant "Router" as Router

Operator -> UI : uses dashboard
UI -> GW : HTTP / WebSocket only
GW -> State : state reads, events, controls
GW -> Env : env/secret writes
GW -x Router : forbidden
UI -x State : forbidden direct call
UI -x Env : forbidden direct call

@enduml
